Ummm.. actually, no.

If your alignment is good, then you have a chance of converting an altar
just by sacrificing something at a non-aligned altar.  (Really it is --
I've done it).  

I believe if your alignment is poor, then you may convert yourself, not
the altar.  This is why killing a co-aligned unicorn and sacrificing it
on a non-co-aligned altar WILL convert you -- killing the unicorn and
sacrificing it really lowers your alignment, making you ripe for
conversion. 


